    "https://www.lmu.de/en/workspace-for-students/career-services/career-and-networking-events/meet-greet-learn-apply/": {
      "title": "Main navigation",
      "description": "Meet & Greet - Learn & Apply - LMU Munich Navigation und Service Direkt zu: Content Main navigation Search Main navigation Research Study About LMU DE Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion Open / close search You are in the following website hierarchy: Home Workspace for Students Career Services Career and networking events You are here: Meet & Greet - Learn & Apply LMU Meet & Greet Get to know a company and your entry opportunities in a relaxed atmosphere. Enlarge The typical course of a Meet&Greet Immerse yourself in the exciting world of networking and discover new professional horizons at the LMU Career Service Event! The typical schedule of a Meet & Greet promises an inspiring experience for your career: 17:45 Check-in 18:00 Welcome 18:05 Company presentation & keynote: Learn more about a company in a keynote on an exciting topic from the respective field of work. approx. 19:00 Open networking with snacks & drinks: Make valuable contacts and exchange ideas in a relaxed atmosphere with snacks and drinks. approx. 20:00 Farewell Don't miss this great opportunity to expand your professional network and gain inspiring insights. Join us and shape your career with us. Click here for an overview and to register for upcoming Meet & Greets. Are you an employer and would like to take part in our events? If you click to view this video your personal data will be transmitted to YouTube and cookies may also be stored on your device. LMU has no influence over how any such data is transmitted or indeed over its further usage. More information available here: LMU data protection policy , data protection policy from YouTube / Google I acknowledge that I have read and understood the information concerning the protection of my data and am willing to display the embedded content despite potential risks. 2:30\n\t\t\t\t        \t\t | \n\t\t\t\t\t        \t17 Sept 2021\n\t\t\t\t        \t\t |  \n\t\t\t\t        \t\t\t©Career Service der LMU Dr.phil. Stephan Pflaum LMU's Career Services Consultant Career Events & Services / Deputy Head of Career Service Send an email Zoom appointment for employers More Johanna Uitz, M.A. LMU's Career Services Consultant for Internationalization & Employability / project manager FIT-LMU International Careers, Events & Seminars, Mentoring, Employer Services Send an email More up Share To share copy Link Share on Facebook Share on Bluesky Share on LinkedIn Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close"
